# ==========================================================
#  Fresh2Cook CRM - Auto Fix
#    1. Processing Steps 2-6 + Rider
#    2. Admin Dashboard: dummy data hata kar LIVE data
#    3. Rider app: sidebar, rider ki details, tasks, earnings, profile
#    4. Rider pickup: available orders ka dropdown
#    5. Resend OTP + customer wala OTP ab badalta nahi
#    6. Admin Settings (commission, free delivery, charges), Admin Orders me OTP,
#       All Pages, Customer login + My Account (orders, reorder, track, wallet, refer)
#
#    7. Home page naya (8 per row), Products page, Customers, policy pages, invoice no. fix
#    8. Purana footer, full-width banner, Refer link (/r/CODE) + WhatsApp/FB/Insta share, pincode message
#    9. Home par 3 barabar box, Admin > Categories se category image (database me)
#   10. Product edit/Best Seller fix, Categories add/delete, bold product cards, refer image
#   11. Best sellers category ke baad, chhota Refer box, Fresh2Cook promise image
#   12. Website text English me, Refer | image | Pincode ek line me
#   13. CSV bulk upload, compact products, category/product priority, chhota banner
#   14. Customer products page: category rail, sort, filters, compact cards
#   15. Banner pehle jaisa full size, pack dropdown me Pack / Piece
#   16. % OFF image se hata kar price ke saath
#   17. Bulk CSV: Sr. No., Unit, Description & Health Benefits, Season; admin card % OFF
#   18. Product images maker, category rename/delete, chhota fixed % OFF
#   19. Hindi naam (???) fix: CSV UTF-8 check + purane ??? naam theek
#   20. Pack price: 1 kg rate, 500 g = half + Rs10, 250 g = quarter + Rs15 (Settings me badlein)
#   21. Naya Fresh2Cook banner (computer + mobile)
#   22. Banner ki height kam (category saath dikhe)
#   23. Cart + Payment compact (wallet), 250g default, drag-drop, processing sidebar, rider se number hataya
#   24. Processing staff: naam, packing list, reward, supplies request, help; Rider wallet UPI + weekly payout; Bunch
#
#  Kaise chalayein:
#    1. Is file ko apne "crm" folder me rakhein
#       (wahi folder jisme package.json hai).
#    2. crm folder me PowerShell kholein aur yeh chalayein:
#         powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\Fresh2Cook-AutoFix-v24.ps1
#
#  Yeh script:
#    - har purani file ka backup  _backups\<date-time>\  me rakhti hai
#    - file ho to update karti hai, na ho to nayi bana deti hai
# ==========================================================

